    "items": [
      {
        "type": "heading1",
        "verse_numbers": [],
        "lines": [
          "Prayer for Restoration"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          1
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Lord, remember what has happened to us.",
          "Look, and see our disgrace!"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          2
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Our inheritance has been turned over to strangers,",
          "our houses to foreigners."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          3
        ],
        "lines": [
          "We have become orphans, fatherless;",
          "our mothers are widows."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          4
        ],
        "lines": [
          "We must pay for the water we drink;",
          "our wood comes at a price."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          5
        ],
        "lines": [
          "We are closely pursued;",
          "we are tired, and no one offers us rest."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          6
        ],
        "lines": [
          "We made a treaty with Egypt",
          "and with Assyria, to get enough food."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          7
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Our ancestors sinned; they no longer exist,",
          "but we bear their punishment."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          8
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Slaves rule over us;",
          "no one rescues us from them."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          9
        ],
        "lines": [
          "We secure our food at the risk of our lives",
          "because of the sword in the wilderness."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          10
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Our skin is as hot as an oven",
          "from the ravages of hunger."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          11
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Women have been raped in Zion,",
          "virgins in the cities of Judah."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          12
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Princes have been hung up by their hands;",
          "elders are shown no respect."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          13
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Young men labor at millstones;",
          "boys stumble under loads of wood."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          14
        ],
        "lines": [
          "The elders have left the city gate,",
          "the young men, their music."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          15
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Joy has left our hearts;",
          "our dancing has turned to mourning."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          16
        ],
        "lines": [
          "The crown has fallen from our head.",
          "Woe to us, for we have sinned."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          17
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Because of this, our heart is sick;",
          "because of these, our eyes grow dim:"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          18
        ],
        "lines": [
          "because of Mount Zion, which lies desolate",
          "and has jackals prowling in it."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          19
        ],
        "lines": [
          "You, Lord, are enthroned forever;",
          "your throne endures from generation to generation."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          20
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Why do you continually forget us,",
          "abandon us for our entire lives?"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          21
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Lord, bring us back to yourself, so we may return;",
          "renew our days as in former times,"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          22
        ],
        "lines": [
          "unless you have completely rejected us",
          "and are intensely angry with us."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      }
    ]
  },
